        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/103111406?u=763693b83a8975e3c8c963a0d2778b5689b6c8d1&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Removed: <code class=\"notranslate\">onautocomplete</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">onautocompleteerror</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">onshow</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">onsort</code> due to not being documented anywhere (only in w3 drafts)<br>\nRemoved: <code class=\"notranslate\">onkeypress</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">onmousewheel</code> due to deprecation</p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Added: <code class=\"notranslate\">onanimationcancel</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">onanimationend</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">onanimationiteration</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">onanimationstart</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">onauxclick</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">onbeforeinput</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">onbeforematch</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">onbeforetoggle</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">onbeforexrselect</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">oncommand</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">oncompositionend</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">oncompositionstart</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">oncompositionupdate</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">oncontentvisibilityautostatechange</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">oncopy</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">oncut</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">onfocusin</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">onfocusout</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">onfullscreenchange</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">onfullscreenerror</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">ongesturechange</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">ongestureend</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">ongesturestart</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">ongotpointercapture</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">onlostpointercapture</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">onpaste</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">onpointercancel</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">onpointerdown</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">onpointerenter</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">onpointerleave</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">onpointermove</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">onpointerout</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">onpointerover</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">onpointerrawupdate</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">onpointerup</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">onscrollend</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">onscrollsnapchange</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">onscrollsnapchanging</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">onsecuritypolicyviolation</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">onselectstart</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">ontouchcancel</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">ontouchend</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">ontouchmove</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">ontouchstart</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">ontransitioncancel</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">ontransitionend</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">ontransitionrun</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">ontransitionstart</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">onwebkitmouseforcechanged</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">onwebkitmouseforcedown</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">onwebkitmouseforceup</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">onwebkitmouseforcewillbegin</code>, <code class=\"notranslate\">onwheel</code></p>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The list is sorted alphabetically.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">The current list is out of date. It contains non-existent and deprecated events.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n\n",
