        {
            "content_html": "<img src=\"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/103111406?u=763693b83a8975e3c8c963a0d2778b5689b6c8d1&v=4\" width=\"64\" height=\"64\" alt=\"\"/><br/><p dir=\"auto\">Mark the 'onunload' event as deprecated.</p>\n\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Description</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\"><a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Reference/Elements/body#onunload\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/HTML/Reference/Elements/body#onunload</a> leads to <a href=\"https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/unload_event\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/Window/unload_event</a> which is deprecated.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Motivation</h3>\n<p dir=\"auto\">Deprecated event should be marked as such.</p>\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Additional details</h3>\n\n<h3 dir=\"auto\">Related issues and pull requests</h3>\n\n\n\n",
